OL,3,GNEWSAPSNI: 25th anniversary a moment of
OL,4,A'great pride', says chief constable
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 25th anniversary of the Police
OL,7,FService of Northern Ireland (PSNI) is a
OL,8,Fmoment to look back on with "great
OL,9,Fpride", the Chief Constable Jon
OL,10,FBoutcher has said.
OL,12,FHe was speaking ahead of a two-day
OL,13,Fconference in Belfast marking the
OL,14,Fmilestone, which is being attended by
OL,15,F160 delegates.
OL,17,FBoutcher said the years had "not been
OL,18,Fwithout challenge".
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
