OL,3,GNEWSAPSNI: 25th anniversary a moment of
OL,4,A'great pride', says chief constable
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe PSNI was created out of the Royal
OL,7,FUlster Constabulary (RUC) as a new
OL,8,Fbeginning for policing, after work by
OL,9,FLord Patten, a former government
OL,10,Fminister.
